---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy & Google AdSense Disclosures: ICSE Resources"
  description="Official Privacy Policy and third-party advertising cookie disclosures for ICSE Resources, including Google AdSense policy and user opt-out options."
  currentPath="/privacy"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 space-y-12">

    <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-foreground transition-colors">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-foreground font-medium">Privacy Policy</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <header class="space-y-4 border-b border-border/40 pb-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 text-primary text-xs font-semibold">
        Legal & AdSense Compliance
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-foreground tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy & AdSense Cookie Disclosures
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Last updated: September 2026. This Privacy Policy details how ICSE Resources handles user data, log files, cookies, and third-party advertising partners like Google AdSense.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Policy Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-10 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">

      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">1. Introduction & Overview</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>ICSE Resources</strong> (accessible at <a href="/" class="text-foreground underline">class10icse.pages.dev</a>), the privacy of our visitors is of paramount importance to us. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of personal information and non-personal analytical data that is collected and recorded by our website, and how we use it.
        </p>
        <p>
          We operate as a free, non-profit academic reference directory. We do not require account registration, do not maintain user databases, and do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data to any external entities.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Mandatory Google AdSense Cookie Disclosure -->
      <section class="space-y-4 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card/80">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">2. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This website may serve advertisements provided by <strong>Google AdSense</strong> and other third-party advertising partners. To ensure compliance with Google's publisher policies, please review the following mandatory third-party cookie disclosures:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-3 text-sm">
          <li>
            <strong>Third-Party Vendor Cookies:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites across the Internet.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Advertising Cookies:</strong> Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partner networks to serve advertisements to our users based on their visits to our site and/or other sites on the World Wide Web.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google DoubleClick DART Cookies:</strong> Google may use DART cookies to serve ads to visitors based upon their visit to our site and other sites on the internet.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Opt-Out Options:</strong> Visitors may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary underline font-medium">Ad Settings</a>. Alternatively, users can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary underline font-medium">aboutads.info</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Log Files & Edge Analytics -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">3. Log Files & Edge Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          Like most standard website servers and content delivery networks (Cloudflare Pages), ICSE Resources follows standard procedures for utilizing <strong>log files</strong>. These files log visitors when they access websites.
        </p>
        <p>
          The information collected by log files includes internet protocol (<strong>IP address</strong>), browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date/time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks. These are not linked to any information that is personally identifiable. The sole purpose of this technical data is for analyzing trends, administering the site, tracking aggregate user movement around the website, and gathering demographic information to ensure site reliability and prevent malicious denial-of-service attempts.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Cookie Management & Control -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">4. How to Manage and Disable Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          You can choose to disable or selectively turn off our cookies or third-party cookies in your individual <strong>browser settings</strong>, or by managing preferences in security software suites. However, this can affect how you are able to interact with our site as well as other websites.
        </p>
        <p>
          Detailed instructions on cookie management with specific web browsers can be found at the browsers' respective official help websites:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li>Google Chrome: Settings &rarr; Privacy and Security &rarr; Third-party cookies</li>
          <li>Mozilla Firefox: Options &rarr; Privacy & Security &rarr; Enhanced Tracking Protection</li>
          <li>Apple Safari: Preferences &rarr; Privacy &rarr; Block all cookies</li>
          <li>Microsoft Edge: Settings &rarr; Cookies and site permissions</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: External Educational Links -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">5. Third-Party Links & Cloud Storage</h2>
        <p>
          Our catalog includes hyperlinks to external educational websites, including Google Drive (for PDF and note previews), the official CISCE portal, Discord, Reddit, and GitHub. If you click on a third-party link, you will be directed to that third party's site. Note that these external sites are not operated by us. Therefore, we strongly advise you to review the Privacy Policy of these external websites. We have no control over and assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party sites or services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 6: Children's Privacy (COPPA Compliance) -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-foreground">6. Children's Online Privacy Protection (COPPA)</h2>
        <p>
          Protecting the online privacy of young students is especially vital. ICSE Resources does not knowingly collect any Personal Identifiable Information from children under the age of 13. If a parent or guardian believes that ICSE Resources has in its database the personal identification of a child under the age of 13, please contact us immediately, and we will use our best efforts to promptly remove such information from our records.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 7: Inquiries & Publisher Contact -->
      <section class="space-y-4 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">7. Contact for Privacy Inquiries</h2>
        <p class="text-sm">
          If you have additional questions, require more information about our Privacy Policy, or have any privacy-related inquiries regarding our compliance with Google AdSense terms, please reach us by visiting our <a href="/contact" class="text-primary underline font-medium">Contact Page</a> or emailing us directly at <span class="font-mono text-foreground font-semibold">jivaansh.yadav@gmail.com</span>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>

    <!-- Navigation Links -->
    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-border/40 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a href="/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:underline">
        &larr; Return to Home
      </a>
      <a href="/about" class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:underline">
        About Us &rarr;
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary hover:underline">
        Contact & Support &rarr;
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
